{"id": "86315", "name": "כלל השרשרת – a·arcsin(bx²) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find the derivative of the following function:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y={{CT:0}} \\sin^{-1}\\left( {{CT:1}} {{CT:2}}^2\\right) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( y' = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> The function is a composition of \\(\\sin^{-1}\\) with the inner function \\(g\\); multiply the derivative of the outer function by the derivative of the inner one.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The inner and outer functions</b><br><p>In order to solve this problem we will have to use the chain rule \\(\\frac{df}{dx}=\\frac{df}{dg} \\cdot\\frac{dg}{dx}\\) as follows:</p><p>Define \\(g({{CT:2}})={{CT:1}}{{CT:3}}\\) and \\(f({{CT:2}})={{CT:0}} \\sin^{-1}\\left( g\\right)\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Differentiating</b><br>So,<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{d{{CT:2}}}\\left({{CT:0}} \\sin^{-1}\\left( {{CT:1}} {{CT:2}}^2\\right)\\right) &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\frac{df}{dg}\\cdot \\frac{dg}{d{{CT:2}}} \\\\ &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\frac{d}{dg}({{CT:0}} \\sin^{-1}\\left( g\\right))\\cdot \\frac{d}{d{{CT:2}}}({{CT:1}} {{CT:2}}^2) \\\\ &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\frac{{CT:0}}{ \\sqrt{1-g^2}}\\cdot {{CT:4}}{{CT:2}} \\\\ &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\frac{{{CT:5}}{{CT:2}}}{ \\sqrt{1-{{CT:6}}{{CT:7}}}} \\end{array} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>To differentiate a function of a function, you must use the chain rule! It is</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\frac{df}{dg} \\cdot\\frac{dg}{dx}.\\]</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>You appear to have applied the chain rule incorrectly. It is</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\frac{df}{dg} \\cdot\\frac{dg}{dx}.\\]</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "f", "g", "n1", "n2", "v", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2", "y"], "nvariants": 49}